. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H4 * (Please adapt according to your needs)
. 
.         * Model: linear OLS regression
.         
.         * We use the variable geneq_std (generated above) as a measure of sup
> port for gender equality (measured by attitudes). 
.         * The variable is an index based on six questions relating to gender 
> equality (plj0620-plj0625).
.         * If the respondent has a higher value on the index, this indicates m
> ore support for gender equality.
.         
.         * Accordingly, we run a linear OLS regression analysis with geneq_std
>  as dependent variable and an interaction between the dummy variable kidsex01
.         * and the dummy variable sex as the independent variable, additionall
> y controlling for the sex of the first child, and the sex and birth year of  
.         * the respondent.
. 
.         
.         reg geneq_std i.kidsex01##i.sex gebjahr, robust

